msgid "Every book you read pays eddies. The gigs on the board pay two to four times more: open one to take it and fix its price. Every 10% you read pays a twentieth of the price, and finishing pays the other half. Longer books and longer waits pay more, up to a month. Hold a gig to roll it for eddies."
